{"unit_id":"zhiheng-zhang-Mera__dsh-health-scheduler#feature-pressure","repo":"zhiheng-zhang-Mera/dsh-health-scheduler","commit":"985e2b7389330db4b32ea2946e3657746c64b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Health Scheduler 的功能「重启压力评估」：定期采集并归一化健康样本，结合多维指标、滚动窗口和趋势形成压力快照。由后台采样循环自动触发，缺少遥测的维度保留为未知。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/scheduler.ts:288-343"]}
